{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310407001:0":{"text":"여러분, 안녕하십니까. 마침 잘 오셨네요. 무도회가 곧 시작될 예정입니다.","source_cn":"诸位，夜安。你们来得正好，舞会快要开始了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26BA631716E57478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310407002:0":{"text":"안녕하세요. 어라? 무도회 의상으로 갈아입지 않으셨네요? 턱시도를 입은 팔라모르 씨를 볼 수 있을 줄 알았는데...","source_cn":"晚上好。咦，你没有换舞会的服装呢，我还以为可以见到穿着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F80C3EACFEB3C7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310407003:0":{"text":"아, 죄송합니다. 저는 무도회장을 순찰해야 해서 해미 양의 요청을 만족시켜 드릴 수 없겠네요. 살아있는 시체를 쫓아야 하는데 정장은 영 불편해서요.","source_cn":"啊，抱歉，没法满足你的要求了。我还得负责巡视场地，驱逐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B7C5C7EBD466C04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310407004:0":{"text":"아, 팔라모르 씨는 제가 본 늑대 중 가장 다정하고 예의 바른 늑대 씨에요!","source_cn":"呀，法拉莫尔先生是我见过最温柔最有礼貌的狼先生了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB42D27ACDC7DC42C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310407005:0":{"text":"그나저나 여러분, 꼭 안전에 주의하셔야 합니다. 무도회에 참가한 사람이 많으니 아시겠지만, 혹시나 “다른 사람”이 숨어들어올까 봐 걱정돼서요...","source_cn":"话说回来，请诸位务必注意安全。参加舞会的人很多，你知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x529A3678AD944824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310407006:0":{"text":"걱정 마세요! 스스로 보호하고, 더 조심하도록 할게요!","source_cn":"放心吧！我们能保护好自己，也会提高警戒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4211754864DFB44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"팔라모르","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}